  Notification small icon for the approved Muslim app identity.

  This is the monochrome 24dp rendering of the same line-art geometry used by
  ic_muslim_launcher_monochrome_v2028. Android applies the final system tint;
  the resource itself therefore remains transparent + opaque white only.

  The thin interlaced square/diamond language, inner architectural frame,
  mirrored upper ribbons, mihrab and crescent deliberately preserve the
  full-colour launcher's visual character without relying on colour or shadow.
-->
